{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも嬉しいコメントをありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ありがとう〜♪」とか\n「おめでとう♪」とか「嬉しい!!」とか\n「へ〜そうなんだ〜すごい!!」とか１人で言いながら読んでるの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント見ながら誕生日だと書いてあるのを見て\nお兄ちゃんも誕生日だっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"て思い出しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハッピーバースデェMAILするの忘れてた..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう遅かったけどさっきMAIL送りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全力で謝りましたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁ許してくれたからよかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、みなみも誕生日だったの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみは誕生日の日にメールしたよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハッピーバースデェ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づけばいつも隣にみなみが大好きよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもヨロシクね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"井上小百合ちゃん\n松村さゆりちゃん\n畠中せいらちゃん\n深川まいちゃん\n西野ななせちゃん\n和田まあや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、焼き肉を食べにいきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうお腹がはちきれそうなほど皆で食べました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんはやっぱり少食なので\nすぐにお腹パンパンになってました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分でずっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『お腹一杯で辛い......目の前に大好きな焼き肉あるのにお腹一杯で食べれない......辛い......』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って隣でか細い声で呪文のように唱えてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ジュースを大量にメンバー飲むんですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄い頻繁にジュース頼むから\n店員さんもジュースを頼むたびに苦笑いしてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『頼みすぎだよね』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って皆で言いながらワチャワチャしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくださいこのご飯"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真っ平"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに間っ平にしてご飯を食べているメンバーは誰でしょうか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の皆の朝御飯は？\nの質問に沢山の方が教えてくれてありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パンの方が多かったな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べてない方も居ましたね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと朝から美味しそうな沢山の種類を食べてる方もいたりして、いいな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはパンが大好きなので、パンが多いかな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お昼もパン食べたりするよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校のコウバイでお昼休みは買います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも沢山並んでるから\n四時間目の授業終わったら走って行くんだっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それとTDLとTDS\nディズニーランドとシーの事なんだね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう〜♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近育ち盛りかな...沢山食べる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、お母さんに\n「そんなに食べたら太るよ！野菜ジュースやカルシウムもとりなさい!!」って言われるの...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前までは、ダイエットしなくていいから沢山食べなさい！っていってたのに..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"簡単に野菜やカルシウムがとれるのないかな〜？...汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し次回するから、今質問くれてる方、待っててね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日寒かったね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体調には気を付けてー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シーユーネクストタイム"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/07/4762159/0003.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}